      "content": "That makes sense. To be more specific though, given the history of the region, how likely is it that these groups will actually cooperate on a national level? In your experience with these types of demographics, do you find that the ethnic distinctions usually lead to frequent tribalized conflict or civil unrest, or can they actually manage to coexist in a modern state structure?",
